          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Tattooist or Permanent Makeup Specialist:",
            "answer": "<p>For the <strong>Tattooist or Permanent Makeup Specialist</strong>, the robust five-star base and ultra-quiet casters provide the fluid mobility needed to navigate around the client station. The integrated circular footrest ensures that even at maximum height, the practitioner maintains a stable, balanced center of gravity, which is essential for steady-hand precision.</p>"
          }
        }
